    "identifier": "uzumaki-uzumaki-art-ablative-seal",
    "description": "<p>You inscribe a Chakra seal onto a willing creatures armor or clothing, reinforcing it with a layer of ablative energies. For the duration, the target creature gains 4 Temporary hit points at the beginning of each of their turns.</p>\n<p>Seal Break. If a creature within 30 feet of you have ranks of Sealed, you can dispel one rank of that creatures Sealed condition to also grant the target of this jutsu 6 Temporary chakra points as part of this jutsu’s casting.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and the Temporary Hit points by +2.</p>",
